-- =============================================================================
--  ISP self-service control centre
--
--  Additive only. Nothing here drops or rewrites existing tables, and every
--  object is keyed on isp_id so row-level security keeps every tenant isolated.
--
--  Adds:
--    * portal_settings      - captive portal branding and copy, per ISP
--    * provisioning_sessions + provisioning_tokens - automatic MikroTik setup
--    * network_settings     - DNS, NTP, bandwidth policy, per ISP
--    * SMS settings + API keys' self-service CRUD RPCs
--    * package/staff helpers the panel needs
-- =============================================================================

